Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 11:56:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add admin-configurable intake required fields.

Store field rules in intake_required_fields, expose CRUD admin APIs and a Settings UI, and validate intake against DB config with sensible defaults (TrustedForm on, DOB off).

