+### Required fields at intake (admin)
+
+Admins manage which payload fields must be present before a lead is accepted at **Settings → General → Intake required fields** (`intake_required_fields` table). Defaults: contact fields + `Trusted_Form_URL` enabled; `DOB` disabled. Custom Boberdoo field keys can be added. If the table is empty, the same defaults apply in code. Per-product Integrity requirements are unchanged (`src/lib/integrity/required-fields.ts`).
 
